lines=['# Make Time — implementation QA','', 'Status: ready-for-root-personal-check. rootPersonalAcceptance=false; publicationAllowed=false.','', 'These are implementation checks on a draft, not editorial approval, full-English collation, scientific efficacy validation or physical Safari certification. Root must personally read both complete manuscripts, all six routes, the full coverage/omission map and key actual primary passages before publication.','', '## Exact text and reading estimates','', 'Main body means the 66 authored prose units; it excludes cover, the shared final, titles, author subtitle, section labels, method/Sources and UI. Framing adds cover/final body, all titles and the author subtitle. The additional noncover-body convention (including final) is also in metrics.json. Rates: RU 180 / EN 220 words per minute. No length quota was enforced.','', '| Route | Screens | RU main body | RU body minutes | RU framing / reader total | RU UI | EN main body | EN body minutes | EN framing / reader total | EN UI |','|---|---:|---:|---:|---:|---|---:|---:|---:|---|']
