lines+=['', 'RU main-screen density: 130–168 words, median 150; EN: 143–187, median 167. These are measured densities after writing and segmentation, not imposed bands. Each scrollable screen is one connected two-paragraph thought unit. Cover and shared final are separately measured.','', '## Structural, parity, and integrity checks','', '- 69 deterministic audit assertions, no warnings/failures. Counts include cover and shared final. Essential IDs are an ordered subset of Core, itself an ordered subset of Deep.', '- Canonical JSON equals the actual embedded screens and sources. All 132 RU and all 132 EN main-body paragraphs equal their drafts in order. All six route exports equal the embedded route bodies and framing exactly.', '- All 87 tactic narratives are individually mapped to actual source file and 1-based inclusive paragraph ranges, a retained mechanism, depth and compression rationale. No whole main chapter is omitted. Image and secondary-example omissions are explicit.', f"- All {len(m['immutableInputs'])} hashed read-only inputs remain byte-identical, including the private extraction, maintained skill/reference reader, old collector and historical review files. Local reader copies are byte-identical to their recorded maintained sources.", '- One primary book-source entry; no duplicate sources used to imply breadth. No copied source chapters, EPUB, publisher artwork or private source quotations are present in the candidate.', '', '## Actual offline Chrome matrix','', '| Viewport | Rendered visits | Interaction assertions in named block | Real nonzero scroll target | Before / after Settings |','|---|---:|---:|---|---|']
